# Further settings of the service, MAILBOX_SERVICE_*. Copy to service.env
# beside compose.yaml and set what you want to change. Every setting and
# its default: packages/mailbox-service/README.md, "Settings".
#
# The image sets the host, the data folder and the key file already. The
# public address and the proxy go into .env.

# MAILBOX_SERVICE_LOG_LEVEL=info
# MAILBOX_SERVICE_SYNC_INTERVAL=300
# MAILBOX_SERVICE_AUDIT_DAYS=90
